### Project URL

https://github.com/abusofianid/game-wave-rider-nusantara

### Category

JS

### Project Title

Wave Rider Nusantara is a cross-platform 2D endless runner celebrating Indonesian culture through batik collectibles, engaging gameplay, and implementations built with React, Rust, and Python.

### Project Description

Wave Rider Nusantara is a 2D endless runner featuring Indonesian culture. Collect batik items, dodge bombs, and explore React, Rust, and Python implementations while learning game development, cross-platform programming, and WebAssembly.

### Highlights

The most interesting aspect of this repository is not simply that it is a 2D endless runner. It is the combination of multi-language development, cross-platform compatibility, Rust and WebAssembly, and Indonesian cultural identity in one project.

It also provides a practical reference for developers interested in learning game development across React, Rust, and Python.

### Example Code

```markdown
import { useState } from "react";

function Game() {
  const [score, setScore] = useState(0);
  const [lives, setLives] = useState(3);

  function collectItem() {
    setScore((previous) => previous + 10);
  }

  function hitObstacle() {
    setLives((previous) => Math.max(0, previous - 1));
  }

  return (
    <main>
      <h1>Wave Rider Nusantara</h1>

      <p>Score: {score}</p>
      <p>Lives: {lives}</p>

      <button onClick={collectItem}>
        Collect Batik
      </button>

      <button onClick={hitObstacle}>
        Hit Bomb
      </button>
    </main>
  );
}

export default Game;
```

